\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.3}{\ignorespaces High-level system architecture: the mobile frontend communicates with the Backend API (\texttt {api.glosy.gr}) and the Reels Service (\texttt {recs.glosy.gr}) over authenticated REST endpoints; both services share a single PostgreSQL instance.}}{25}{}%
